- # Upbit Trading Engine
- A stability-focused automated trading SKILL designed for Upbit.
- This SKILL follows ClawHub submission standards and operates using a single request-response execution model.
- - Market data retrieval (REST-based)
- - Technical indicator calculation (RSI, MACD, ATR, Bollinger Bands)
- - Volatility breakout strategy signal generation
- - Risk validation (minimum order size, balance verification, fee awareness)
- - Market buy and sell execution
- - State machine-based position management
- - Automatic 429 (Rate Limit) retry handling
